<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Micro started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Micro started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview Financial Group Inc said analyst Scott Randall initiated coverage of Advanced Micro Devices Inc with a short-term buy rating and a long-term hold rating.</p>
<p>-- set 1997 earnings estimate of $1.36 a share and set 1998 earnings estimate of $3.70 a share.</p>
<p>-- Advanced Micro gained 2-3/8 31-3/4.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
